# The Beast Within's 32001 and 6 arms the main flow leaves: two level 75 Blue Mages at level cap 75, The Beast Within
# accepted at Prog 2 (a GM), each with a Blue Mage's Testimony, by the Jade Sepulcher's door _1v0 (maxPlayers 1: one
# char per area). Main: the testimony traded (requiredItems: its wear count rises; the item kept): the 32000 menu; area
# 1 (option 33); RAUBAHN brought to 1 HP (unkillable; his onMobFight wins the fight under 20% HP): 32001 opens;
# battlefieldWin cleared by a GM with 32001 open: finished: no 6 (still accepted). bob: area 2 (option 34), RAUBAHN+1
# (area 2's): 32001: battlefieldWin 1154: 6 started; a full bag: 6 finished: cap 75 (not 70): kept, no message; the
# Scroll of Instant Warp does not fit (giveItem unchecked); completed whatever (Master of Ambition). carl (a level 66
# Blue Mage at level cap 69, a GM's): area 3 (option 35), RAUBAHN+2: 6: cap 69 (not 70): kept, no message; the scroll;
# completed.
lists JadeSepulcher/_1v0/onTrade JadeSepulcher/onEventFinish/32001 JadeSepulcher/onEventFinish/6
char zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char bob zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=75
char carl zone=JadeSepulcher pos=300,-2.517,-198.5 job=BLU lvl=66
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
item BlueMagesTestimony
bob: levelcap 75
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
bob: item BlueMagesTestimony
carl: levelcap 69
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.AnEmptyVessel completed
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.Transformations completed
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.TheBeastWithin accepted
carl: charvar Quest[6][40]Prog 2
carl: item BlueMagesTestimony
login
trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1        # Prog 2: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=33                  # area 1
finish
kill RAUBAHN                            # 1 HP
tick 1000                               # (CHECK where 32001 opens)
tick 1000
localvar battlefieldWin 0               # a GM, 32001 open
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 0: no 6
bob: login
bob: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1   # Prog 2: the 32000 menu
bob: update 32000 option=34             # area 2
bob: finish
bob: kill RAUBAHN+1                     # area 2's Raubahn: 1 HP
tick 1000                               # (CHECK where 32001 opens)
tick 1000
bob: finish                             # battlefieldWin 1154: 6 started
bob: fill-inventory
bob: finish                             # 6: cap 75 kept, no message; no scroll (full); completed
carl: login
carl: trade _1v0 BlueMagesTestimony x1  # Prog 2: the 32000 menu
carl: update 32000 option=35            # area 3
carl: finish
carl: kill RAUBAHN+2                    # area 3's Raubahn: 1 HP
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000                               # his onMobFight wins: 32001 opens
carl: finish                            # battlefieldWin 1154: 6 started
carl: finish                            # 6: cap 69 (not 70) kept, no message; the scroll; completed
